{"candidateAnswer":"Dancer Pose and Tree Pose","evidence":"[D4:14 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: We were trying out different dance poses, like Warrior II, which builds strength and boosts focus.\n[D14:3 | 9:17 am on 26 June, 2023] Deborah: By the way, I tried a new pose - Dancer Pose (Natarajasana). Rate, did I succeed?\n[D14:15 | 9:17 am on 26 June, 2023] Deborah: I'd rather show you a photo. This is also a new yoga pose that we tried. It is a tree pose.","itemId":"urn:uuid:41f1e8bc-ebfe-5807-8c5e-7de383f0c97c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3e359ef24e4d728ae4e8e7226a21450a922806211a198bdebe2d152a142f6619","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What new yoga poses did Deborah try?","referenceAnswer":"Warrior II, Dancer Pose (Natarajasana), Tree pose","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3e359ef24e4d728ae4e8e7226a21450a922806211a198bdebe2d152a142f6619"}}]}